<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Wah interim net down 94.87 pct.</title>
<headline>Cheung Wah interim net down 94.87 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.02	vs  0.30</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.95 gain vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    0.11	vs  2.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		     148.47    vs  168.62</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cheung Wah Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Cheung Wah Development is a dyeing, printing and dyestuffs distributor.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain from the transfer of land use rights in respect to land located in China.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
